OL,3,ACatherine's cancer documentary makes me
OL,4,Afeel less alone, says Strictly's Amy   
OL,5,ADowden                                 
OL,7,FDowden, Strictly's first Welsh         
OL,8,Fprofessional dancer, was diagnosed with
OL,9,Fstage 3 breast cancer at 32 and has    
OL,10,Fundergone chemotherapy and two         
OL,11,Fmastectomies.                          
OL,13,FCatherine's BBC documentary, Heal, will
OL,14,Freveal how cancer has impacted her     
OL,15,Foutlook on life, as well as the people,
OL,16,Fplaces and experiences that have helped
OL,17,Fher.                                   
